{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rock the Rim</i>, a cinematic visual novel that fuses the thrill of basketball and the passion of music with choice-driven storytelling. Step into Andr\u00e9\u2019s world: challenge rivals on the court, captivate hearts with your compositions, and unravel the mysteries of your past. Every decision shapes your narrative and destiny\u2014what path will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/Gif.gif?t=1744388638\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich world filled with over 80 unique characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 1,400 cinematic static images and 46 cinematic animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 hours of immersive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 original songs composed exclusively for the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">32 atmospheric sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">54 ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cinematic storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A deep choice system that shapes Andr\u00e9\u2019s journey</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story and Choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As Andr\u00e9, at 18, you\u2019re navigating a world brimming with talent and potential. Raised by Logan and Fiona, this home feels utterly unfamiliar. Blake\u2019s jealousy pushes you away, while Kayla\u2019s hidden affection stirs your thoughts. Faint memories of your past\u2014unresolved family secrets\u2014haunt every step. Will you become a basketball superstar on the court or shine as a rock star on stage? Your choices shape interactions with over 80 characters and steer the story\u2019s course. Will you climb to fame and leave the past behind, or succumb to the weight of those memories?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/600x225-3.png?t=1744388638\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rock the Rim</i> blends the energy of basketball and the fervor of music with a cinematic mystery. Andr\u00e9\u2019s court smashes, stage rhythms, and a world of over 80 characters will captivate you. Original music and cinematic animations make every moment unforgettable. Replay to explore different paths and relationships, crafting your story anew time and again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/600x225-1.png?t=1744388638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/600x225-2.png?t=1744388638\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Episodes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rock the Rim: Season 1 - Episode 1</i> launches Andr\u00e9\u2019s adventure! This episode delivers a striking beginning. Continue with <i>Episode 2</i>, <i>Episode 3</i>, and beyond\u2014each available as separate DLCs. Andr\u00e9\u2019s past and future unfold step by step through these additional stories.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522430?t=1744388638","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/61b1e3b0304f49f7513620d319d222f11fe5bd15/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744388638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/0ea09b04e6414550248521ffd49ef5101b012089/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744388638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/0ea09b04e6414550248521ffd49ef5101b012089/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744388638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descriptio