lake\u2019s jealousy pushes you away, while Kayla\u2019s hidden affection stirs your thoughts. Faint memories of your past\u2014unresolved family secrets\u2014haunt every step. Will you become a basketball superstar on the court or shine as a rock star on stage? Your choices shape interactions with over 80 characters and steer the story\u2019s course. Will you climb to fame and leave the past behind, or succumb to the weight of those memories?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/600x225-3.png?t=1744388638\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rock the Rim</i> blends the energy of basketball and the fervor of music with a cinematic mystery. Andr\u00e9\u2019s court smashes, stage rhythms, and a world of over 80 characters will captivate you. Original music and cinematic animations make every moment unforgettable. Replay to explore different paths and relationships, crafting your story anew time and again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/600x225-1.png?t=1744388638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/extras/600x225-2.png?t=1744388638\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Episodes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rock the Rim: Season 1 - Episode 1</i> launches Andr\u00e9\u2019s adventure! This episode delivers a striking beginning. Continue with <i>Episode 2</i>, <i>Episode 3</i>, and beyond\u2014each available as separate DLCs. Andr\u00e9\u2019s past and future unfold step by step through these additional stories.</p>","developers":["Waifuz"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522430/header.jpg?t=1744388638","is_fr